"""
Authorization directives.

BridgeCore enforces these as resolver decorators applied where the schema is
built (see graph/directives.go) rather than as SDL directives, so that the
checks are literally the same code the REST middleware runs — one role
ordering, one entitlement resolver, one set of audit records. The declarations
below document the effective policy on each field.
"""
directive @requiresRole(role: Role!) on FIELD_DEFINITION
directive @requiresFeature(feature: String!) on FIELD_DEFINITION
